@feenberg we have an argument `--disable-salt` which is setting the value of `state_and_local_sales_or_income_tax` to 0, causing the `salt_deduction` to be set to 0. In this case, it will trigger the standard deduction of $29,200. 

It is a command line argument e.g.:
`python policyengine_taxsim/cli.py test.csv --logs --disable-salt`
